      </a>
      <a href="/salary/4-5-lpa" class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-[#fafafa] dark:bg-[#181818] hover:bg-[#f0f0f0] dark:hover:bg-[#202020] transition-colors text-center group">
        <strong class="text-[#0070f3] block font-medium">₹4.5 LPA</strong>
